---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About — ${SITE.name}`} description="How NepalHelpDesk works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="article-head">
      <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    </div>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        {SITE.name} is a small help desk run by tech enthusiasts in Kathmandu. We keep an eye on
        Nepali online communities — Reddit's r/Nepal and r/technepal, tech blogs and news feeds —
        for the most repeated technical problems, then research and publish clear, step-by-step
        fixes.
      </p>
      <h2>How accuracy is handled</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Every guide is fact-checked against official support pages and reliable sources before publishing.</li>
        <li>Each article shows a "Last checked" date and its sources.</li>
        <li>We re-check and refresh guides older than 90 days so the steps don't go stale.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>ISP router setups and WiFi fixes — WorldLink, Vianet, Subisu, NT Fiber</li>
        <li>e-Governance errors — Nagarik App, NID, passport, driving license, NOC</li>
        <li>FinTech workflows — eSewa, Khalti, free .com.np domains</li>
        <li>Micro-merchant guides — Daraz seller dashboard and payouts</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} is not affiliated with any ISP, bank, or government office. Guides are
        community-sourced and independently checked.
      </p>
      <p>
        Facing a problem we haven't covered? Ask in the comments on a related guide, or get in
        touch and we'll dig into it.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
